<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6774724277"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:54.353"><div begin="48.392" end="56.870" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.392" end="51.119" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.392" end="48.896">老天</span><span begin="48.896" end="49.299">规定</span><span begin="49.299" end="49.592">我</span><span begin="49.592" end="49.827">与</span><span begin="49.827" end="50.498">众不</span><span begin="50.498" end="51.119">同</span></p><p begin="51.317" end="53.907" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.317" end="51.749">走起</span><span begin="51.749" end="52.122">路来</span><span begin="52.122" end="52.479">莫</span><span begin="52.479" end="52.682">名</span><span begin="52.682" end="53.290">就有</span><span begin="53.290" end="53.907">风</span></p><p begin="54.102" end="56.870" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.102" end="54.538">什么</span><span begin="54.538" end="54.897">规矩</span><span begin="54.897" end="55.261">我</span><span begin="55.261" end="55.460">都</span><span begin="55.460" end="56.164">懒得</span><span begin="56.164" end="56.870">懂</span></p></div><div begin="59.757" end="1:08.183" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="59.757" end="1:02.340" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.757" end="1:00.180">从小</span><span begin="1:00.180" end="1:00.555">到大</span><span begin="1:00.555" end="1:00.864">没</span><span begin="1:00.864" end="1:01.131">什</span><span begin="1:01.131" end="1:01.846">么笑</span><span begin="1:01.846" end="1:02.340">容</span></p><p begin="1:02.605" end="1:05.184" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.605" end="1:03.035">不说</span><span begin="1:03.035" end="1:03.396">话时</span><span begin="1:03.396" end="1:03.725">我</span><span begin="1:03.725" end="1:03.943">经</span><span begin="1:03.943" end="1:04.649">常放</span><span begin="1:04.649" end="1:05.184">空</span></p><p begin="1:05.262" end="1:08.183" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.262" end="1:05.517">但</span><span begin="1:05.51